      150     run proc-alt-shift-f2.
      151   end.
      152   on alt-shift-f3 anywhere do:
      153     run proc-alt-shift-f3 in this-procedure .
      154   end.
      155   on alt-shift-f4 anywhere do:
      156     run proc-alt-shift-f4 in this-procedure.
      157   end.
      158   on alt-f1 anywhere do:
